# Core platform

Nx monorepo. Brand **swoop**. Prices are **cents**. Auth is **HttpOnly cookies + CSRF** (Postman may send Bearer).

| App | Port |
|---|---|
| user-service | 3000 |
| product-service | 3001 |
| inventory-service | 3002 |
| cart-service | 3003 |
| order-service | 3004 |
| web (shop) | 5173 |
| admin (staff) | 5174 |

Shared code: import `@core-platform/common` only (never `packages/common/src/...`).

**Category** = taxonomy slug on the product. **Featured** = `featured: boolean`, not a category. **All** = `/shop`. Do not invent `all`/`featured` category rows.

Redis: throttle, logout denylist, catalog cache — not carts/orders/stock. [docs/redis.md](docs/redis.md).

Folder patterns: [docs/conventions.md](docs/conventions.md). Map of the system: [docs/architecture.md](docs/architecture.md).
